@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@
+---
+id: dl-003-price-sub-day-rentals-by-whole-hours
+type: decision-log
+title: "Price sub-day rentals by whole hours"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Context
+
+Visitors may need equipment for only an afternoon. Daily rentals remain calendar-day periods, while
+the new hourly option must give a clear, deterministic price and avoid accepting partial hours.
+
+## Decision
+
+Permit rental periods shorter than one day when both UTC timestamps fall exactly on an hour. Price
+those periods at the equipment's `hourlyPrice` multiplied by their whole-hour duration, rejecting
+the request when that optional price is absent. Retain daily pricing and its three-day discount only
+for whole-day, midnight-to-midnight periods.
+
+## Consequences
+
+Equipment validates an optional nonnegative safe-integer hourly price. Availability and booking
+conflict detection can use the same hourly boundaries. Periods of a day or longer must remain whole
+UTC days, preserving the established daily rental model.
