@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@
+---
+id: task-004-add-hourly-equipment-rentals
+type: task
+title: "Add hourly equipment rentals"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Work completed
+
+Added the optional `hourlyPrice` to equipment and immutable inventory storage. Rentals shorter than
+one day now accept exact UTC-hour boundaries and use that price for each hour; equipment without an
+hourly price rejects these requests. Whole-day pricing and its three-day discount remain unchanged.
+The availability and booking-period validation now accept the same short hourly intervals. Updated
+the public API documentation and README (version 4).
+
+## Verification
+
+Classified hourly pricing and its missing/invalid-price handling as new behavior requiring red-first
+tests. Before implementation, the new hourly quote and booking tests failed because timestamps were
+restricted to midnight. After implementation, `npm test` passes all 17 tests and TypeScript
+compilation, and `git diff --check` passes. The added tests cover quoted and booked hourly periods,
+availability conflicts, absent hourly prices, invalid hourly prices, and zero hourly prices.
